[I] Plugins of Cairo-Dock project

[T] This package contains the Cairo-Dock plug-ins, a collection of views,
[T] applets, animations and effects for Cairo-Dock. Cairo-Dock is a light
[T] and convenient desktop dock featuring multiple docks, a taskbar and
[T] launchers.

[U] https://github.com/Cairo-Dock/cairo-dock-plug-ins

[A] Cairo-Dock
[M] René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>

[C] extra/tool
[F] CROSS

[L] GPL3
[V] 3.6.2

[D] 1313de7628208693956ffa720c5c60fea43e101543192cbde9c1f556 cairo-dock-plug-ins-3.6.2.tar.gz https://github.com/Cairo-Dock/cairo-dock-plug-ins/archive/3.6.2/

